# Reset combo while a save dump is in progress, with the game writing backup
# SRAM continuously (churn): the reset must settle (flush) the save, toggle
# the loading state and come back to the running game. gba_memory clears the
# backup type at loading=1, so this also proves the firmware's
# gba_resend_backup_type() reached the RTL: after the reset, a fresh game
# write must dirty the save AGAIN (no type -> no backup_written -> no
# notice -> no dump -> wait-dump times out and fails).
expect-screen "TangCore"
press down
press down
press b
expect-screen "game.gba"
press down
press a
expect-overlay off
expect-core gbatang
wram-burst 0x000 512 0x5A
churn on
poke-save 0x10 0x42
wait-dump
hold select+start+r 500ms
expect-overlay off
churn off
poke-save 0x20 0x77
wait-dump
expect-save-ram 0x20 0x77
